      <Capitolo>Technical Data - Lubricants</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;B&gt; Manufacturer: &lt;/B&gt; Volkswagen AG &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt; Designation: &lt;/B&gt; 0D9 / DQ250 &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt; Trade name: &lt;/B&gt; DSG6, S-Tronic &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;B&gt; Oil change interval recommended by the automatic gearbox manufacturer: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; 60,000 km &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;TABLE class=&quot;contenuto&quot; width=99% border=1 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0&gt; &lt;TH width=60% class=&quot;chiaro&quot;&gt; Description &lt;/TH&gt; &lt;TH width=25% class=&quot;chiaro&quot;&gt; Unit of measurement &lt;/TH&gt; &lt;TH width=15% class=&quot;chiaro&quot;&gt; Data &lt;/TH&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Automatic gearbox code: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Ref. No. &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; 0D9 &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Number of gears: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; No. &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; 6 &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Automatic gearbox oil – Manufacturer’s specification: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Ref. No. &lt;/TD&gt;  &lt;TD&gt; VW G 052 182 A2/A6 &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Automatic gearbox oil – Drained quantity: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Litres &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; 6.9–7.2 &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Automatic gearbox oil – Quantity for replacement: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Litres &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; 5.2 &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Automatic gearbox oil – Gearbox-cleaner quantity: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Litres &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; 8.9–9.2 &lt;/TD&gt;  &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;TR&gt; &lt;TD&gt; Temperature for checking automatic gearbox oil level: &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; °C &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;TD&gt; 35–45° &lt;/TD&gt; &lt;/TR&gt; &lt;/TABLE&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; Check the automatic gearbox oil level whilst the engine is running. &lt;BR/&gt; </Corpo>
